Give two copies the same junction but vary one thing:

I_A(J,C)

versus:

I_B(J,C+\delta).

Then:

\Delta Choice
=
Choice_B-Choice_A.

Now we’re doing a counterfactual probe of the reader.

Change rhythm only.

Change category only.

Change ordering only.

Change one word.

Add one earlier Pattern Book entry.

Remove punctuation.

Prime one imp with a metaphor.

Give another literal language.

Their divergence estimates which variable affected the routing.

That’s NTE turned inward.

